# Temporary seams until huge/mod.rs and meta.rs are verified: Verus
# checks the descriptor type and Meta once they are inside verus!, and
# storage and release once Meta's allocation calls hand out the
# permissions they assume.
HugeDesc	allocator invariant	Verus
Meta	allocator invariant	Verus
Table::storage	allocator invariant	Verus
Table::release	allocator invariant	Verus
